<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Escaper Map | Home</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Escaper Map helps you find escape rooms by city and theme, then plan your next trip with an interactive map." />
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://escapermap.com/" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary-bg: #701f1f;
      --secondary-bg: #9d2b2b;
      --accent-color: #fdd835;
      --border-color: #080808;
      --text-color: #ffffff;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #9d2b2b 0%, #701f1f 100%);
      color: var(--text-color);
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    #topBar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 20;
      height: 64px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 0 18px;
      background: var(--primary-bg);
      border-bottom: 3px solid var(--border-color);
    }

    #topBar img { width: 44px; height: 44px; object-fit: contain; }

    .brand-title {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    .topbar-nav {
      margin-left: auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .topbar-link {
      display: inline-block;
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--text-color);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      padding: 8px 14px;
    }

    .topbar-link:hover { border-color: var(--accent-color); }

    .topbar-link.active {
      background: var(--accent-color);
      color: #111;
      border-color: var(--accent-color);
    }

    main {
      max-width: 980px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 28px 18px 40px;
    }

    h1, h2 { margin: 0 0 12px; }
    p, li { line-height: 1.55; }

    .hero {
      border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 18px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      padding: 12px;
    }

    .actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .btn-link {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--accent-color);
      border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      color: #111;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    footer {
      border-top: 3px solid var(--border-color);
      padding: 14px 18px;
      background: var(--primary-bg);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      #topBar { gap: 8px; padding: 0 10px; }
      .brand-title { font-size: 0.95rem; letter-spacing: 0.03em; }
      .topbar-nav { gap: 4px; }
      .topbar-link { font-size: 0.8rem; padding: 6px 9px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header id="topBar">
    <img src="logo.png" alt="Escaper Map logo">
    <div class="brand-title">Escaper Map</div>
    <nav class="topbar-nav" aria-label="Primary">
      <a class="topbar-link active" href="/" aria-current="page">Home</a>
      <a class="topbar-link" href="/faq/">FAQ</a>
      <a class="topbar-link" href="/map/">Map</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Welcome to Escaper Map</h1>
      <p>
        Escaper Map is a project for escape room players who want to discover new rooms, compare themes,
        and plan better trips. Use it to find escape rooms in your city, filter by style, and save your route.
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn-link" href="/map/">Open the Map</a>
        <a class="btn-link" href="/faq/">Read FAQ</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="grid" aria-label="Highlights">
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Find by City</h2>
        <p>Search and filter rooms near your location or in the city you plan to visit next.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Find by Theme</h2>
        <p>Discover horror rooms, puzzle-focused rooms, and riddle-heavy adventures.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Plan Your Route</h2>
        <p>Build your itinerary and map your escape room trip from one place.</p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    © Escape Rooms Map • Connect with your favorite escape room locations and save your plans.
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
